{"title":"20 Favorite Children’s Books from 20 Years of The Marginalian","link":"https://www.themarginalian.org/2026/10/25/20-childrens-books/","date":1792959196000,"content":"<p>“Anyone who writes down to children is simply wasting his time,” E.B. White <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2015/02/26/e-b-white-writing-for-children/\">insisted</a>. “You have to write up, not down. Children are demanding. They are the most attentive, curious, eager, observant, sensitive, quick, and generally congenial readers on earth.”</p>\n<p>Both as a reader of them and as <a href=\"http://themarginalian.org/books\">a writer of them</a>, I have never considered “children’s books” a separate category of literature: The best children’s books are works of philosophy in disguise, shining a sidewise gleam on the fundamental questions we live with, articulating in the language of children, which is the language of great simplicity and great profundity, the most complex truths about being human. But reducing a lifetime of reading to just <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2026/10/24/20-books/\">twenty favorite books</a> to mark <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/qKd8UMjQ2Mo\" target=\"_blank\">twenty years of <em>The Marginalian</em></a> was so tortuously hard that I am sneaking in another twenty under the dubious label “children’s.”</p>\n<h5>THE LITTLE PRINCE</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Little-Prince-Anniversary-Downloadable-Audio/dp/054797048X/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/thelittleprince_original.jpg?w=325&amp;ssl=1\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2014/02/03/exupery-little-prince-morgan-drawings/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE DARK WOOD OF THE GOLDEN BIRDS</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Dark-Wood-Golden-Birds/dp/1961341638/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/darkwood_ofraamit_cover.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2026/10/25/dark-wood-margaret-wise-brown-ofra-amit/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>MOOMINLAND MIDWINTER</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Moominland-Midwinter-Moomins-Tove-Jansson/dp/0312625413/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/moominlandmidwinter.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2015/01/22/tove-jansson-moominland-midwinter-moomintroll/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE LOST WORDS</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lost-Words-Robert-Macfarlane/dp/1487005385/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/thelostwords1.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2019/06/17/the-lost-words-macfarlane-morris/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>BIG WOLF &amp; LITTLE WOLF</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Big-Wolf-Little-Nadine-Brun-Cosme/dp/1592700845/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bigwolflittlewolf.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2017/10/12/big-wolf-little-wolf/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE WANTING MONSTER</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Wanting-Monster-Martine-Murray/dp/1592704190/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thewantingmonster_cover.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/05/29/the-wanting-monster/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>CRY, HEART, BUT NEVER BREAK</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cry-Heart-But-Never-Break/dp/1592701876/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/03/cryheartbutneverbreak-2.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2016/03/08/cry-heart-but-never-break/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>OCEAN OF STARS</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Ocean-Stars-Azita-Ardakani/dp/1592704913/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/oceanofstars_cover.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2026/10/02/ocean-of-stars-azita-ardakani/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>KENNY’S WINDOW</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Kennys-Window-Maurice-Sendak/dp/0060287896/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/mauricesendak_kennyswindow.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2016/01/08/kennys-window-maurice-sendak/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>IF YOU COME TO EARTH</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/You-Come-Earth-Sophie-Blackall/dp/145213779X/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/IYCTE_cover.jpg?resize=768%2C963&amp;ssl=1\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2020/12/05/if-you-come-to-earth-sophie-blackall/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THIS IS A POEM THAT HEALS FISH</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/This-Poem-that-Heals-Fish/dp/1592700675/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/03/poem_fish.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2017/03/24/this-is-a-poem-that-heals-fish/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE LION AND THE BIRD</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/The-Lion-Bird-Marianne-Dubuc/dp/1592701515/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/lionandbird_dubuc.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2014/05/07/the-lion-and-the-bird-marianne-dubuc/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE HEART AND THE BOTTLE</h5>\n<p><a href=\"AMAZON\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/heartbottle.jpg?w=325&amp;ssl=1\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2015/05/14/oliver-jeffers-the-heart-and-the-bottle/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>THE OSBICK BIRD</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Osbick-Bird-Edward-Gorey/dp/076496335X/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/osbickbird_gorey.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2020/05/28/the-osbick-bird-edward-gorey/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>ALICE’S ADVENTURES IN WONDERLAND</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Alices-Adventures-Wonderland-Tove-Jansson/dp/B001GIN3CC/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/tovejansson_alice.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2014/06/30/tove-jansson-alice-in-wonderland/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>IN THE HALF ROOM</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.mcnallyjackson.com/book/9781536214567\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/carsonellis_halfroom.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2025/03/21/half-room-hemispheric-neglect/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>WHAT DO YOU KNOW?</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/What-You-Know-Aracelis-Girmay/dp/1592703216/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/whatdoyouknow_cover.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2024/09/15/what-do-you-know-girmay-fields/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>SOMETHING ABOUT THE SKY</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Something-About-Sky-Rachel-Carson/dp/1536228702/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/somethingaboutthesky.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2024/03/13/something-about-the-sky-carson-mcclure/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>AT THE DROP OF A CAT</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://enchantedlion.com/all-books/at-the-drop-of-a-cat\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/atthedropofacat_cover.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2023/11/16/at-the-drop-of-a-cat/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<h5>FERDINAND</h5>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Story-Ferdinand-Munro-Leaf/dp/044845694X/?tag=braipick-20\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.themarginalian.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/ferdinand_munroleaf0.jpg\" width=\"325\" /></a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2022/07/09/ferdinand-civilon/\"><strong><em>Why I love it</em></strong></a></p>\n<hr /><h3>donating = loving</h3><p>For seventeen years, I have been spending hundreds of hours and thousands of dollars each month composing <em>The Marginalian</em> (which <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/2021/10/22/brain-pickings-becoming-the-marginalian/\">bore the outgrown name <em>Brain Pickings</em></a> for its first fifteen years). It has remained free and ad-free and alive thanks to patronage from readers. I have no staff, no interns, no assistant — a thoroughly one-woman labor of love that is also my life and my livelihood. If this labor makes your own life more livable in any way, please consider lending a helping hand with a <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/donate/\">donation</a>. Your support makes all the difference.</p>\n\n<hr />\n\n<h3>newsletter</h3>\n<p><em>The Marginalian</em> has a free weekly newsletter. It comes out on Sundays and offers the week’s most inspiring reading. Here’s <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/brainpickings/janna-levin-rebecca-elson-anne-lamott-james-gleick\">what to expect</a>. Like? <a href=\"https://www.themarginalian.org/newsletter/\">Sign up.</a></p>","author":"Maria Popova","siteTitle":"The Marginalian","siteHash":"052ac1be0de11784b9ef27664fbcf33da8263d0e7cb9c6e601ccd959f2d3aa78","entryHash":"07cecebdef68dfc17ab34468f731ed1de32f1c8a151d8217f516932fe5dae9bc","category":"Sites"}